OL,3,APrimark takes further step into online
OL,4,Ashopping with home deliveries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrimark has said it plans to launch a
OL,7,Fhome delivery service in Britain, four
OL,8,Fyears after it made its first foray
OL,9,Finto e-commerce.
OL,11,FThe retailer said it had bought a
OL,12,Ffulfilment facility in Sheffield to
OL,13,Fenable it to ship products to homes.
OL,15,FPrimark did not sell goods online until
OL,16,F2022, when it launched a
OL,17,Fclick-and-collect service which meant
OL,18,Fshoppers still had to travel to pick up
OL,19,Ftheir purchases.
